# skillui reconnaissance dumps (reference-site screenshots + raw computed
# styles, several MB of PNGs per site). The distilled findings — the only
# part meant to ship — live in docs/references/<site>/NOTES.md, tracked.
docs/references/*/skillui/

# Raw media build input (36MB source for scripts/build-media.mjs).
# Output lives in public/media/ and is tracked; the raw source is not.
